      (co_imS hM.2.2.1 hM.2.2.2) (sh_imS hD.2.2.1 hD.2.2.2) hv3.2 (by rw [length_imS]; norm_num) (by norm_num)
    rw [imS_sum M.c M.d x y g3 (by rw [g3ur, gur]; rfl) (by rw [g3ui, gui]; rfl)
